<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | 7 Days to Die Cheats" description="Privacy information for visitors to dayscheats.com."><section class="pt-28 pb-20 md:pt-36"><article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5"><h1 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-5xl font-bold uppercase">Privacy policy</h1><div class="prose prose-invert mt-8 max-w-none text-muted-foreground"><p>Last updated: 18 November 2026.</p><p>This informational site does not request account credentials. Merchant purchases are handled by the merchant after you leave this site.</p><h2>Information and links</h2><p>Standard hosting and analytics providers may process technical request data such as browser type, IP address, and pages requested. External destinations have their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Do not submit sensitive data through unverified channels. Contact the appropriate merchant or service provider for data requests relating to their service.</p></div></article></section></BaseLayout>
